  "notes": "ISDA CZK annual swap rate: vs 3M PRIBOR below 2Y, 6M PRIBOR from 2Y — and Bloomberg's quotes AGREE per their NAMEs: CKSW1 is 'ANN (VS 3M)', CKSW2+ 'ANN (VS 6M)'. Re-banded 2026-08-03: CKSW1 was feeding the 6M band, booking the 1y 3s6s into the 6M curve; it now sits on the 3M band with a PRIB03M depo and the 3X6/6X9 FRAs (sub-2y desk queries stop pricing off a 2-FRA extrapolation). 6M band front = monthly 6M FRA strip CKFR0AG..0F1 (1X7..6X12) + 12X18, mirroring YCSW0320 exactly (PRIB06M + 0AG..0F1 + 011F + CKSW2..15 — Bloomberg uses NO 1Y swap, the 6X12 FRA is its 12M point). CZEONIA OIS quotes live on CKSO{n} 1-10Y (found 2026-07; 15Y/20Y resolve but no px) — bilateral market, not cleared. OIS conventions assumed Annual ACT/360 payLag 1; 'CZEONIA Index' fixing ticker does NOT exist on API — onFixingTicker left empty. Verify vs SWPM. FRA strip added 2026-07 (composite-only full securities) to shape the front end between swap pillars; FRAs whose maturity clashes with a quoted pillar are skipped by the bootstrapper. FWCM S0320 cross unreliable >10y (audit 2026-07: +29/+64/-32bp at 10Y10Y+; our curve reprices the quoted CKSW ladder exactly - trust pillars over FWCM at the long end)."
